\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 1. Objective\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Develop a modern, responsive web application that enables users to create, manage, and track their personal habits. The application should encourage consistency by displaying progress, streaks, completion statistics, and a motivating dashboard.\
This application is intended for a single user and does not require authentication in the initial version.\
The overall experience should feel premium, minimalistic, intuitive, and visually polished.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

